  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2404.02 Non-Sulfur Emission Standards For Non-Ferrous Foundries, Smelters, and Investment Casting Operations Installed After February 18, 1972",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2404.02 Non-Sulfur Emission Standards For Non-Ferrous Foundries, Smelters, and Investment Casting Operations Installed After February 18, 1972. Subject to Env-A 2405.03, below, for any non-ferrous foundry, smelter, or investment casting operation installed after February 18, 1972, the owner or operator shall not cause or allow the emission of particulate matter, including fumes, to exceed the emission standards specified for “New Devices” in Table 2102-1.\n\nSource. #6428-B, eff 1-18-97 (formerly Env-A 1206); ss by #8214, eff 11-24-04; ss by #10315, eff 4-23-13 (from Env-A 2406.01); ss by #13694, eff 7-22-23",
